        "heading": "We Cut Open 9 “Amazon” Copper Bottles. What’s Actually Inside a $29 “Copper” Bottle.",
        "subhead": "Seven of the nine had something other than copper inside them. The other two lied about how they were made. Not one listing was accurate.",
